Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.49,OP,,0,0,0,,Preparado?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.49,0:00:49.15,OP,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.74,OP,,0,0,0,,Não esqueceu nada?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:52.07,OP,,0,0,0,,Tudo pronto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.20,OP,,0,0,0,,Mal posso esperar.
Comment: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.99,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sob o céu azul,
Comment: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:56.37,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(Essa palpitação)
Comment: 0,0:00:56.37,0:00:58.08,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,diante do mar azul.
Comment: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.75,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(não tem fim)
Comment: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:02.54,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,Vamos criar juntas
Comment: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:09.22,OP Beach 0,,0,0,0,karaoke,lembranças inesquecíveis.
Comment: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:18.56,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,Procurando uma desculpa para nos reunirmos
Comment: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:23.27,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,e dividirmos esses sentimentos alegres
Comment: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:24.40,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,por cinco!
Comment: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:27.61,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,Nós continuamos as mesmas
Comment: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:31.36,OP Balloon,,0,0,0,karaoke,aonde quer que estejamos,
Comment: 0,0:01:31.36,0:01:36.20,OP Star,,0,0,0,karaoke,como se estivéssemos conectadas.
Comment: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:42.62,OP Star 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tenho certeza que espirramos quando uma fala da outra.
Comment: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.79,OP Beach,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sob o céu azul,
Comment: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:46.34,OP Beach,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(Essa empolgação)
Comment: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.00,OP Beach,,0,0,0,karaoke,diante do mar azul.
Comment: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.42,OP Beach,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(não tem fim)
Comment: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:55.47,OP Beach,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sorrisos brotam do fundo do coração.
Comment: 0,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.51,OP Beach 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sob o céu azul,
Comment: 0,0:01:57.51,0:01:58.77,OP Beach 2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}(Essa palpitação)
