Comment: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:35.17,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Quando o sol nasceu e a luz banhou a manhã
Comment: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:42.80,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,senti que algo estava prestes a acontecer.
Comment: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:51.27,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Preciso abrir essa porta e deixar você saber.
Comment: 0,0:22:51.27,0:22:57.98,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Seria um desperdício manter isso só pra mim.
Comment: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:10.66,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Um, dois, três...
Comment: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:15.33,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Se dividirmos...
Comment: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:23.21,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Quatro, cinco...
Comment: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:30.68,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,Os sonhos vão se expandir.
Comment: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:39.19,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}Sorria, sorria, e, quando perceber,
Comment: 0,0:23:39.19,0:23:46.95,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}aqueles que importam estarão ao seu lado.
Comment: 0,0:23:46.95,0:23:55.04,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}Sorria, sorria, e esses sentimentos comoventes
Comment: 0,0:23:55.33,0:24:03.09,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}vão pintar memórias
Comment: 0,0:24:03.09,0:24:08.64,ED,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\an3}neste novo dia.
